{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Legends of Azamar",
    "steam_appid": 3556700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends of Azamar is a fast-paced action RPG focused on loot, dungeon crawling, and visceral combat. Answer the call of Bar-Ulduun, a once-proud dwarven city now consumed by darkness. Driven by glory, treasure, or duty, descend into the depths, battle deadly foes, and uncover the secrets that lie within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the depths as the mighty Warrior, the cunning Rogue, or the\u00a0enigmatic Mage, each wielding unique weapons, abilities, and play styles. Adapt, experiment, and uncover the legends buried deep within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Crawling Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends of Azamar is an ARPG condensed to its core.\u00a0Descend, fight, loot, return to camp, and repeat. Face increasingly deadly challenges as you push deeper, growing stronger with each expedition, culminating in brutal boss fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to face Bar-Ulduun's ever-shifting depths? Each expedition will never be the same with procedurally generated dungeons, quests, and unique items to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Path</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your  character with legendary equipment, powerful passives, and devastating abilities. Shape your path with six unique passive skill trees, each offering new avenues of character customisation. Will you become an unbreakable juggernaut by following the path of the Tower? Or embrace the Serpent\u2019s cunning, and strike with lethal poisons? Or will you walk your own path?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends of Azamar is a fast-paced action RPG focused on loot, dungeon crawling, and visceral combat. Answer the call of Bar-Ulduun, a once-proud dwarven city now consumed by darkness. Driven by glory, treasure, or duty, descend into the depths, battle deadly foes, and uncover the secrets that lie within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through the depths as the mighty Warrior, the cunning Rogue, or the\u00a0enigmatic Mage, each wielding unique weapons, abilities, and play styles. Adapt, experiment, and uncover the legends buried deep within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Crawling Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends of Azamar is an ARPG condensed to its core.\u00a0Descend, fight, loot, return to camp, and repeat. Face increasingly deadly challenges as you push deeper, growing stronger with each expedition, culminating in brutal boss fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to face Bar-Ulduun's ever-shifting depths? Each expedition will never be the same with procedurally generated dungeons, quests, and unique items to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Path</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your  character with legendary equipment, powerful passives, and devastating abilities. Shape your path with six unique passive skill trees, each offering new avenues of character customisation. Will you become an unbreakable juggernaut by following the path of the Tower? Or embrace the Serpent\u2019s cunning, and strike with lethal poisons? Or will you walk your own path?</p>",
    "short_description": "Step into the world of Avendor and brave the ancient ruins of Bar-Ulduun, a fallen dwarven city overrun by the restless dead. Descend into ever-shifting depths, grow in power, and claim legendary loot as you uncover the Legends of Azamar in this visceral loot-driven action RPG.",
